Bhai error simple hai 😄

Tumne ye command chalayi:

```powershell
git remote -v https://github.com/kushwahadk799-lgtm/infra.git
```
`git remote -v` ke baad **URL nahi lagta**. `-v` ka kaam sirf existing remote URL dikhana hai.

### Agar remote check karna hai:

```powershell
git remote -v
```

### Agar `origin` ko us GitHub repo se connect karna hai:

```powershell
git remote add origin https://github.com/kushwahadk799-lgtm/infra.git
```

Phir check:

```powershell
git remote -v
```

### Agar `origin` already bana hua hai aur URL change karna hai:

```powershell
git remote set-url origin https://github.com/kushwahadk799-lgtm/infra.git
```

**Tumhare current case mein**, agar `todo` folder ko `infra` GitHub repo se connect karna hai, mujhe bata—main **VS Code se exact step-by-step** aage karwata hoon.
